.Dd March 12, 2026
.Dt PCI_MSIX 9
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm pci_enable_msix
.Nd enable MSI-X for a PCI function
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In kern/pci.h
.Ft int
.Fn pci_enable_msix "pci_device_t *dev" "int nvec"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn pci_enable_msix
function validates the requested vector count against the MSI-X table
size and enables MSI-X in the device control register.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
0 is returned on success.
Otherwise a negative error code is returned.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr pci_find_capability 9
